WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:00.934 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-You -- you worked here.

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is there anything you learned
from working here

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:06.373
that now that you're in charge,
you're bringing to that project?

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.340 line:92%
-Well, I learned a lot from you.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.743
Like, every morning I walk into
the writers' room,

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:13.380
and I reference a foreign film
that no one has possibly seen.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh. Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:17.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, "Did you see
'The Dark Trombone'"?

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Everyone in Slovenia is
talking about it."

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I think that's a thing
people like.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.858
-Mm. Yeah, no one ever --
no one ever watches them.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.926 size:81% position:41%
-I always assumed that
after I left the room

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.595 size:75% position:38%
you all talked about
how exciting it was

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:31.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I told you about a film
you didn't want to see.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:33.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's what we said.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.602 line:92%
That's definitely what we said.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you think
you're a good boss so far?

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:41.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, I'm really lucky
because I have --

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:44.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't have any Michelles
on my staff.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:45.378 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
So all my writers
are really nice.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:48.281 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
You would even write things
on purpose

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.552
just because you wanted to hear
me say them.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
You didn't think
they would work.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:55.121 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:56.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You just thought
they would delight you

00:00:56.222 --> 00:01:00.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I would fail,
and you enjoyed my failure.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's fun.
-Yeah.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:02.128 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.664
Is there anything -- is there
anything that you're not good at

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they figured out
that they want to make you do?

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:10.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, no, they figured out
almost immediately

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.272 size:88% position:44% line:92%
that I can't do accents.

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:12.705 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.508
-And so they write into a lot of
the jokes, me doing an accent,

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I can't do --
like, I can't do any accent.

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can barely do my voice.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:24.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, your voice seems like
it takes a lot of energy.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:25.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:26.352 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's so hard!

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The fact that -- I mean,
the fact that you --

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.924
I mean, with the calories you
burned in that 50-mile race,

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:34.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
how did you have anything left
to speak for, like, days?

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, it was easy,
I'm telling you.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:38.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
You wouldn't have been able
to do it.

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:39.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.568 size:88% position:44%
-All right, let's try --
can we try some accents?

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:44.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just don't think of it.
Clear your head.

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:45.872 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Scottish.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Foreign accent ]
The little doggie...

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.243 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:51.945 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
...went golfing.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:54.881 line:92%
-What? Little doggie what?

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:58.551 line:92%
-The little doggie went golfing.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:00.153 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Australian.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:04.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Australian accent ]
Down under we have sharks.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.192 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:06.693 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Way better.

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Normal voice ]
That wasn't too bad.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:09.129 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-No, that was better.

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:11.664
It's certainly better than
"little doggie went golfing."

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:12.632 line:92%
-I don't know why I feel like

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:15.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have to say something
they would say.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:15.568 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, right.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:16.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, every time you meet
anyone,

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
they give you two details
about their country.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.474 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Germany.

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:24.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ German accent ]
Das, no, ya, okay!

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:25.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.512 --> 00:02:27.013 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-That was your best one.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.482 line:92%
That was by far your best one.

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.250 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.086
You mentioned -- I heard you say
that the nice thing

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:34.154 line:92%
about you having your own show

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:36.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
is you can now tell jokes
that you wouldn't --

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:39.092
either your bosses on your old
shows, "The Daily Show" or here,

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:41.027 size:88% position:44%
wouldn't be able to say
or wouldn't let you say.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:44.430
What are some of the subjects
you're tackling that you can --

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.498 line:92%
you have the freedom to do now?

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:48.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Normal voice ]
Yeah, I got a lot of fun stuff

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:50.770 line:92%
that you wouldn't let me do.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.238 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-What kind of stuff?

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:52.772 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait until they laugh at
this one.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:57.844
You know what's great about
a joke -- when you set it up.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.746 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:03.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll tell jokes like,
well, like, when Hillary --

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:05.919
it's like, I really wanted to
have the first female president.

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:07.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
It'd be great to have Hillary
be the president,

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.456
because then you could show
that women can do anything

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
as long as their husband
did it first.

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:16.262 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:19.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I would have loved to have
Bill Clinton

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:20.533 size:81% position:41% line:92%
as the First Gentleman

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:22.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
because the spouse of
the President

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:26.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
is the one who sometimes give
tours of the White House,

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:29.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I would have loved to see
Bill be like,

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:30.810 size:81% position:41% line:92%
"These are our drapes.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.947 line:92%
They're covered in my semen."

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:34.614 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:38.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Everything in this office is
covered in my semen."

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:38.918 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.320 line:92%
"Don't turn on a black light."

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think that's
an excellent advertisement

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:46.793
for "The Break
with Michelle Wolf" on Netflix.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:47.493 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I'm so happy for you.

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:48.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can't wait to see
your new show,

00:03:48.595 --> 00:03:50.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's just always so
wonderful to have you here.

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:52.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, thanks.
You said "here" wrong.

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:56.035 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:58.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so wonderful
to have you "herr."

00:03:58.371 --> 00:04:01.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you turn into 50 Cent
at the end of that?

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:02.508 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:05.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's so -- it's so great to
have you "her."

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.080 line:92%
-I'm sorry, that's Nelly!

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What?
-Nelly. Sorry.

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:09.716 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Let's look --

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:11.684 line:92%
-Don't end the segment, Seth!

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:12.452 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Yeah, that's right.

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:15.855
When I end the segment, you have
to go back to work.

00:04:15.855 --> 00:04:18.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
Give it up for Michelle Wolf,
everybody.

